   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Is there a package that has a dependency on the spatialite linked library?  If it isn&#39;t working, it may not be explicitly specified in which case could you file an issue here: <a href=\"https://github.com/rstudio/shinyapps-package-dependencies\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/rstudio/shinyapps-package-dependencies&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792361753952000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0qDb3qBRHw3CNicU8wYBBF\">https://github.com/rstudio/shinyapps-package-dependencies</a><div><br></div><div>Thanks,</div><div>Tareef</div></div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div class=\"gmail_extra\"><div class=\"gmail_quote\">On Mon, Aug 1, 2016 at 12:51 PM,  <span dir=\"ltr\">&lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">mrj...@gmail.com</a>&gt;</span> wrote:<br></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div class=\"gmail_extra\"><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">Hi, <div><br></div><div><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"2\" face=\"arial, sans-serif\">I was wondering if anyone has used spatialite databases in a <a href=\"http://shinyapps.io\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://shinyapps.io&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792361753952000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2EngeRJ4rDUSJA7Anlo1bQ\">shinyapps.io</a> hosted app. For spatialite to work the lib file (mod_spatialite.dll or mod_spatialite.so) needs to be available and is accessed using the query <span style=\"line-height:20px;white-space:pre-wrap\">&quot;</span><span style=\"line-height:20px;white-space:pre-wrap\">SELECT load_extension(&#39;mod_spatialite.dll&#39;)</span><span style=\"line-height:20px;white-space:pre-wrap\">&quot;. My shiny app was built on a windows machine so I use the .dll version of the query, I expect this is different on <a href=\"http://shinyapps.io\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://shinyapps.io&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792361753952000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2EngeRJ4rDUSJA7Anlo1bQ\">shinyapps.io</a> but I am not sure if it is even available.</span></font></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(24,54,145);font-family:Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:20px;white-space:pre-wrap\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(24,54,145);font-family:Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:20px;white-space:pre-wrap\">thanks in advance...</span></div></div></blockquote></div></div>"
    ],
